ROVA — PRODUCT BUILD MASTER PROMPT

Build a complete, production-oriented logistics and delivery platform named ROVA.

Brand positioning:

ROVA is a modern delivery and logistics network designed primarily for merchants, retailers, entrepreneurs, businesses, brands and professional sellers.

ROVA connects businesses with nearby delivery drivers, motorcycles, cargo vehicles, vans and partner fleets, enabling instant deliveries, scheduled deliveries, multi-stop routes, fleet reservations and real-time shipment tracking.

ROVA must be designed as a scalable logistics company and technology ecosystem, not simply a courier marketplace.

Tagline:

MOVING BUSINESS FORWARD.

Secondary positioning:

Delivery designed for business.

