01 — PRODUCT VISION

ROVA must provide a seamless logistics ecosystem connecting:

* Merchants and businesses
* Independent delivery drivers
* ROVA-owned drivers and vehicles
* Fleet partners
* Cargo and van operators
* Delivery recipients
