* Administrators

The platform must support both immediate delivery requests and planned commercial delivery operations.

Businesses must be able to request a single delivery, schedule deliveries in advance, organize multiple recipients into one route, reserve vehicles for a full day and manage their delivery activity from one account.

The long-term architecture must support multiple cities, multiple countries, multiple fleet partners, thousands of drivers and high volumes of deliveries.

